    "intro": "Dia 1: Chegada em Cusco e aclimatação A cidade de Cusco é a porta de entrada para o mundo […]",
    "content_html": "\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.gtperutravel.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/destinos-top-peru--1024x726.png\" alt=\"Imagen actual: destinos-top-peru-cusco\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1.4104743624897176;width:429px;height:auto\"/></figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"dia-1-chegada-em-cusco-e-aclimatac-ao\"> Dia 1: Chegada em Cusco e aclimatação</h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/IfbTlBQFbyufNTwAPV0A9r2l2kWZXec8J7bu_G8yRLKl4stPcCLD8fRjZsse_3EvSTS_OTge6TyYs64ZQsHi8KM7ANxfkPHpTB33Ax2cFtCla_Pgi0NnCXQlzqco3j6muKk9hUGD90kBHQuTc9TJrsROR9UL1aYNd78Lc3CNG6wh_NMzObZi63ddF-IvnY_q?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/JvP9uFqiMs77G0BnEC1FV0MwaxeqCZ0pY5V2KjMAoHnpETXWe2rL1gtdw_GT1pgyMcFxPnClHiN89mDwqK4DZPhgIjuR7S6xO7TeH7BWhtc6LuVbRUPpLmXefvbCQ8HYNSildYvCk26QqOLaBrZySN11vs5_aaetp_NQA08KY6OLoGocpaPXOCTDkuhi7CHW?purpose=fullsize\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1.505854800936768;width:449px;height:auto\"/></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A cidade de Cusco é a porta de entrada para o mundo andino. O primeiro dia é ideal para descansar e se adaptar à altitude.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"recomendac-oes\">Recomendações:</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Passear pela Plaza de Armas</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Visitar o bairro de San Blas</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Experimentar a comida típica peruana</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"> Se você está procurando tours organizados e pacotes completos, pode conferir as opções da<br><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https://www.gtperutravel.com/?lang=es&amp;utm_source=chatgpt.com#nuestros-paquetes\">GT Peru Travel</a></p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"dia-2-vale-sagrado-dos-incas\"> Dia 2: Vale Sagrado dos Incas</h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/iepX0QRUkkA5P7jh7Nr-ZHFtnvkpus2-zMYcJh7pgaeAkDCUJT79Nv6agUewtO4u3u0zXVGIdtQzRpeK57k_5KkhuazYlBkW-06mKVsanth6h2kTAfhNKu86w07sGMsukYVXt7y4tGe2JHnquUg9_K2lCo-qoWi5UgkzQki7ZSX0KEmjSpbUKp5_sNy6pSoq?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/DLLyti9qEUqHSvuBCeuk6_eFVki3NFWDkKdQcOFZyl9XAAUTVAW3TuqZDjFRXx24faOfP1k9AmjN7fPkKvzh1ogy10T5I7__--OfCUvrJLrW6TV0uN7Xu-W4DX66i6_eNvyLbcBPMVijJEnrVyVE_rLy0tR48ZqsR2wkG92YtDe4j3HBASIUK0UYgB0LVULt?purpose=fullsize\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1.5000364511190494;width:447px;height:auto\"/></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Visite lugares impressionantes como:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Pisac</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Ollantaytambo</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Urubamba</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Muitos viajantes escolhem pacotes que incluem transporte e guia para economizar tempo e facilitar a logística.</p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"dia-3-machu-picchu\"> Dia 3: Machu Picchu</h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/Dm01gBHOuiWHumWqisN2X4MMOF2wKLNhYXPocGSQegTmMhtgwU5hjxuuDs0Hwqkpyj0ijffBD4Vplrp5tpuMfgnqgH_tpToLiQab5QpxmGNdmo24lFtco4zBHAxNpNQq8XscUDXeQwEVdctkE_dlmhmbC72oxWldvPZJK_knniVxNhkDlQDuKlQ1_QRdj7W6?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/tT7bJSC58hHQ9L19GvK_Ddf5dsY39bPalZEudgbubqtSzIeiTaJX8wnW4cFVZaU1ddX15yPKDJQ8RbTmzaHID6-0GjwkfOYScmxWU7bmtGyV7Av4VP9VIyZxsZ-huYK75b801CrMUWoNDFhuhMMvk4a9ra3LS20bV_UFPEmrwJEAcivAiklhnJCDaEwSdOm6?purpose=fullsize\" style=\"aspect-ratio:2.0023355391202804;width:448px;height:auto\"/></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">O dia mais esperado da viagem.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Uma visita a Machu Picchu inclui:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Viagem de trem</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Ônibus ecológico</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Tour guiado</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A GT Peru Travel oferece tours e pacotes personalizados para Machu Picchu e experiências em Cusco.</p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"dia-4-montanha-das-7-cores\"> Dia 4: Montanha das 7 Cores</h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/kgzn7fdABDL0XcQvhHq_wexaky3Q131VTEGS4csPBSGmJPai0eDED7chFQ7I-eW1tMqBIn_lB1E4lvx1OhecUMSJ6Xmbvpxw8-0tHq1zMDyJT1GjZuaFBJEHa7gn7tvtgxOH6Ef8XfxaxohWzyh3WdDrwJ1_suL0i9e58OOtWrQ?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/7YS8jMkGw6Ptox1ZG87IHmXq34cgf3Qtpog9a3RGLu3d_CORexzsHcd8ZpYl7zPg3HbRU_AvVdIGbGG3WZeN63hh_KkBMdPAlyysPGnmaUkMBKyUdWwli-I-nEeXHVlPycYyR9493fNyvfx0amczTwHMiMg68aZsUD50kIq9x8ZVpTSj_XhfOovxgExQJ_ip?purpose=fullsize\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1.3337222492302707;width:445px;height:auto\"/></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A famosa Rainbow Mountain é um dos passeios mais populares do Peru.</p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"dia-5-lagoa-humantay\"> Dia 5: Lagoa Humantay</h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/KmwtOPyC0VQjurkYGgvzcuV-Hj03cXryKTfxqwWFoFh3CYqm1jQboDN7sMq0hUPyl2tnGwHAqfoBaacrjVNG3o_38j-dzPCOi9g53Qxyq7xfFimG30o3HquWm1TzD_8rA_SxA417MGq1yoJIbId5BE-ZaoWkNJ9esW0vleyV8f0?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/x4z_PF660W6KPE4DvUvJFM7_HLkFNwXOlZCGlcqrTaw9abY-ADcyfLSpcDQCxUF3Z5X1NfOg2ir7sWjlG3gcAfxJ6CH1JyZXPSVt5Y15TYIcPpHDTBjdK-GJHRQX_SZNb_TDWGhhofarPseeZt-0xznqDqWVaTgTGZJoMnTcJahsezv_nfU4sA5Xzz5PVsD9?purpose=fullsize\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1.3337222492302707;width:480px;height:auto\"/></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Paisagens incríveis e uma caminhada moderada cercada por montanhas nevadas.</p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"dia-6-city-tour-em-cusco\"> Dia 6: City Tour em Cusco</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Visite:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Qorikancha</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Sacsayhuamán</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Tambomachay</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"dia-7-compras-e-despedida\"> Dia 7: Compras e despedida</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Aproveite:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Artesanato local</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Cafés</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Gastronomia peruana</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"dicas-para-viajar-a-cusco\"> Dicas para viajar a Cusco</h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Melhor época: abril a outubro</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Reserve Machu Picchu com antecedência</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Leve roupas para frio e sol</li>\n</ul>\n",
